body:
From app dev perspective I can tell that it is really hard to debug minified code.
`requestSubscription()` resolves to:
```
{
    endpoint:"https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/#code#",
    expirationTime:null,
    options:PushSubscriptionOptions {userVisibleOnly: true, applicationServerKey: ArrayBuffer(65)}
}
```

`await (await navigator.serviceWorker.getRegistration()).pushManager.getSubscription()` resolves to the exactly the same as the above object.
